- code/format (flutter, swiftui, swift, pnpm, ruff, mise): paths now ./-prefixed unless absolute, passed after --; closes option injection from a leading-dash filename. dprint reads each path as a glob, so *, [ or { in a name can widen the set it formats — reformatting in-repo files only; no execution, no traversal.
